[1m[38;5;231mWhich approach should the design follow?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mA: Handler calls tracker (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mlogin stays pure auth; submit handler awaits it then calls trackEvent. Clearest boundaries, fewest moving parts.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m B: login emits internally
     [38;5;246mTracking can't be forgotten, but couples auth to analytics and makes login harder to test.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m C: Event bus
     [38;5;246mFully decoupled and extensible, but real indirection for one event and one consumer today.[39m
